---
import FeatureCard from '@chassis-ui/docs/components/FeatureCard.astro'
import Code from '@chassis-ui/docs/shortcodes/Code.astro'
---

<section class="home-section py-3xl md:py-6xl">
  <div class="container 2xl section-content">
    <div class="row mb-3xl md:mb-6xl">
      <header class="section-header col lg:col-10 xl:col-8 text-center mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-title font-3xl md:font-4xl lg:font-5xl mb-xs md:mb-sm lg:mb-md">
          <span class="font-normal d-block">From Design</span> to Production
        </h2>
        <p class="section-body md:font-lg lg:font-xl m-0">
          Run one command to copy the source into the output of each platform. The build takes care
          of the file names, the resolution variants and the folders of the web, iOS and Android.
        </p>
      </header>
    </div>

    <div class="section-features row row-cols-1 md:row-cols-3 g-md md:g-xl">
      <div class="col">
        <FeatureCard icon="cx-number-one">
          <Fragment slot="title">Structure Source Folders</Fragment>
          <Fragment slot="body">
            Put the files under <code>source/</code>, by brand, app and type. The files of default/
            go to every brand, and a brand folder holds the files that replace them.
          </Fragment>
          <Code
            noToolbar
            lang="text"
            containerClass="border-top border-subtle pt-md mt-auto"
            code={`source/
├── default/
│   └── demo/
│       └── images/
│           ├── brand-logo.svg
│           ├── hero-img.png
│           └── hero-img@2x.png
└── example/
    └── demo/
        └── images/
            └── brand-logo.svg`}
          />
        </FeatureCard>
      </div>

      <div class="col">
        <FeatureCard icon="cx-number-two">
          <Fragment slot="title">Run Build Command</Fragment>
          <Fragment slot="body">
            Run pnpm assets to build every job, or use the --brand, --app and --platform options to
            build a part. The build copies, renames and sorts the files for each platform.
          </Fragment>
          <Code
            noToolbar
            lang="bash"
            containerClass="border-top border-subtle pt-md mt-auto"
            code={`# Build every job
pnpm assets

# Build specific brand
pnpm assets --brand chassis

# Build specific app
pnpm assets --app demo

# Build with filters
pnpm assets --brand chassis --app demo`}
          />
        </FeatureCard>
      </div>

      <div class="col">
        <FeatureCard icon="cx-number-three">
          <Fragment slot="title">Integrate Build Output</Fragment>
          <Fragment slot="body">
            The <code>dist/</code> folder has one folder per platform, app and brand. Copy the folder
            of your job into your web, iOS or Android project, or build it in CI.
          </Fragment>
          <Code
            noToolbar
            lang="text"
            containerClass="border-top border-subtle pt-md mt-auto"
            code={`dist/
├── ios/demo/example/images/
│   ├── brand_logo.svg
│   ├── hero_img.png
│   └── hero_img@2x.png
└── android/demo/example/images/
    ├── drawable/
    │   ├── brand_logo.svg
    │   └── hero_img.png
    └── drawable-xhdpi/
        └── hero_img.png`}
          />
        </FeatureCard>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
